{"version":1,"key":"card:728","content":{"id":728,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d4497487-d8dc-43d3-b0ea-609213646ec8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在链式调用 Promise 时，有时会不小心向 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".then()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".catch()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传入一个非函数值（比如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、字符串甚至另一个 Promise 对象），这时程序并不会报错，而是出现一种\"值穿透\"现象：前一个 Promise 的结果会直接跳过这些无效的处理器，传递给后续第一个有效的回调。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"50124073-94ee-4eee-9bc2-8d7fd1c18dff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这背后的依据是 Promise/A+ 规范的一条规则："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"a95c5e0e-d79a-4e5b-a258-10645a1c5607","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aaf7ed98-c0eb-4a97-8308-94e064321d01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"onFulfilled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"onRejected"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不是函数，则必须被忽略，Promise 采用前一个 Promise 的值进行 resolve。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e33c6e7f-c65c-40c9-89cb-d6ad495b290d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也就是说，当传入非函数参数时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".then()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的行为等价于："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0bfee9b3-897b-4657-9bdb-2e7f6041969f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ee047631-39a9-4a86-8d3a-bac108260c7a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"then(非函数, 非函数) => then((v) => v, (err) => { throw err })","collabId":"c462f037-7908-4efb-b8a6-ceb2389d5752","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c49ca02-1a99-44b4-8f14-c7d6b3c5916d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"理解了这个机制，再看下面两个例子就很清晰了。第一个例子中，无论传入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、字符串还是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise.resolve(2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们都不是函数，所以最初 resolve 的值 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一路穿透到最后："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d6b8b9ac-43bc-410e-9877-e657d560b636","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f3feb5dd-fd26-4766-978d-63aaeb75ca38","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Promise.resolve(1)\n  .then(null)\n  .then(undefined)\n  .then(\"Hello\")\n  .then(Promise.resolve(2))\n  .then(console.log) // 1","collabId":"eb1e3c09-7c75-4e85-9e7b-3126574d0a72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"73b5a517-a12b-40b8-b108-cd9527fef5b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同样的规则也适用于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".catch()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。下面这个例子中，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new Error(\"New Error\")"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都不是函数，因此最初 reject 的错误对象会穿透到最后一个有效的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".catch()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中被打印出来："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b8abc413-8788-4d8f-9fa2-6633275dc146","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f3333a50-531a-447d-b2cc-f5e484520fb2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Promise.reject(new Error(\"Unknown Error\"))\n  .catch(null)\n  .catch(undefined)\n  .catch(new Error(\"New Error\"))\n  .catch(console.log) // Error: Unknown Error","collabId":"9a53acc1-d6dc-41cb-bbf8-009ba9722df0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Promise"],"createTime":1779148135484,"updateTime":1791088826424,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791088826424}}